l to get attuned to their territory, which is a radius of about ten miles. Remember this is the 16th century, 10 miles is going to take alot of time to traverse.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The other path, Path of the Shadow World, allowed you to see, banish, control, and raise an a troop of ghosts. The final power even allows you to enter the shadowlands. Not only that, when you enter the shadowlands, other wraiths will see you as one of them, albeit one that's a bit more solid. Best part is that you can bring others with you.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">When looking at the powers possessed by this bloodline can you really sit there and believe that they could have been exterminated by regular humans? A couple careless neonates and fledglings getting caught and killed I can believe. But not an entire bloodline, and definitely not one as organized as the Telyavelic tremere which still kept to a pyramid structure similar to the main clan.</span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Allow me to offer a hypothetical on to how such an incredibly powerful and dangerous bloodline could be exterminated:<br /> <br /> They were killed during the day.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-23T18:16:06-07:00","id":1479384,"title":"","content":"They picked what ended up being the losing side between paganism and Christianity. It's perfectly fitting both real history and some of the themes of Dark Ages Vampire that they didn't make it - but V20 does support a small number of Telyavelics surviving into the modern nights by inflitrating the ranks of the Sabbat's Tremere Antitribu, if you want to go with that or any other scenario of your own devising.<br /> <br /> Every narrator in Vampire is unreliable, and I can't stress that enough. They're claimed to have been wiped out in the 16th Century by their parent clan - there's no reason why that couldn't just be the Pyramid writing off a failed experiment or a disappointing band of runaways and deciding to never think of them again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11599,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","user":"Reasor","date":". 04-23-2022, 09:28 PM"},